# Which zone each ESP32 zone light shows, by the last 4 hex digits of its Wi-Fi MAC
# (the "mac" in /pulse, or `boards status`). Used by scripts/boards.sh flash and
# scripts/flash-zone-lights.ps1 for a board that has no zone stored yet; a board
# keeps the zone it learned (in flash) across reflashes.
7B54=A
C72C=B
